/// Bridge table linking tenancies to Transitional Housing referrals for the same client (Tangata Whaiora ID) with a 3-day date-overlap tolerance. Calculated table: for each non-'Waitlisted' referral it matches every tenancy in the same client's chain where Referral Accepted Date >= Chain Start Date - 3, Referral Discharge Date <= Chain End Date + 3 (or the chain is still open / discharge blank), Referral Discharge Date >= Tenancy Start Date, and Referral Accepted Date <= Tenancy Vacated Date + 3 (or the tenancy is current). Grain: one row per matching referral-tenancy pair (~4,746 rows over ~4,070 distinct tenancies). Joins to Tenancy on Property Tenancy ID (single direction).
